---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 380;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}
---
<figure class="dgf">
  <div class="dgf-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Diagram of GitHub's October 21 2018 incident. A 43 second link cut isolates the East Coast data center. Orchestrator nodes in the East Coast public cloud and the West Coast data center form a quorum and promote West Coast primaries. After the link returns, writes go to the West while the East holds a few seconds of unreplicated writes, so failing back is unsafe and recovery takes 24 hours and 11 minutes.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="t-h" data-lang-en>What happened on October 21, 2018</text><text x="20" y="24" class="t-h" data-lang-vi>Chuyện xảy ra ngày 21/10/2018</text>
      <rect x="318" y="38" width="566" height="150" rx="8" class="box-q" />
      <text x="330" y="58" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Orchestrator nodes (Raft consensus) in these two sites agree on a quorum</text><text x="330" y="58" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Các node Orchestrator (đồng thuận Raft) ở hai nơi này lập được quorum</text>
      <rect x="20" y="66" width="268" height="112" rx="6" class="box-r" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={258} y={86} size={26} />
      <text x="34" y="90" class="t-b" data-lang-en>US East Coast data center</text><text x="34" y="90" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Data center US East Coast</text>
      <text x="34" y="106" data-lang-en>MySQL primaries, Orchestrator node</text><text x="34" y="106" data-lang-vi>Primary MySQL, node Orchestrator</text>
      <text x="34" y="122" class="t-r" data-lang-en>Cut off from the hub for 43 s</text><text x="34" y="122" class="t-r" data-lang-vi>Bị cắt khỏi hub trong 43 giây</text>
      <text x="34" y="138" data-lang-en>A few seconds of writes not yet</text><text x="34" y="138" data-lang-vi>Vài giây ghi chưa kịp sao chép</text>
      <text x="34" y="154" data-lang-en>replicated to the West</text><text x="34" y="154" data-lang-vi>sang West</text>
      <rect x="336" y="74" width="240" height="96" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="cloud" x={548} y={96} size={26} />
      <text x="350" y="98" class="t-b" data-lang-en>US East Coast public cloud</text><text x="350" y="98" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Public cloud US East Coast</text>
      <text x="350" y="114" data-lang-en>Orchestrator node</text><text x="350" y="114" data-lang-vi>Node Orchestrator</text>
      <text x="350" y="130" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Still reaches the West</text><text x="350" y="130" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Vẫn nối được tới West</text>
      <rect x="600" y="74" width="270" height="96" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={846} y={96} size={26} />
      <text x="614" y="98" class="t-b" data-lang-en>US West Coast data center</text><text x="614" y="98" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Data center US West Coast</text>
      <text x="614" y="114" data-lang-en>Orchestrator node, MySQL replicas</text><text x="614" y="114" data-lang-vi>Node Orchestrator, replica MySQL</text>
      <text x="614" y="130" data-lang-en>Promoted to primary after</text><text x="614" y="130" data-lang-vi>Được nâng lên primary sau</text>
      <text x="614" y="146" data-lang-en>the quorum voted</text><text x="614" y="146" data-lang-vi>khi quorum bỏ phiếu</text>
      <path d="M 295 114 L 311 130 M 295 130 L 311 114" class="ln-r" />
      <text x="20" y="226" class="t-h" data-lang-en>Then each step made the next one harder</text><text x="20" y="226" class="t-h" data-lang-vi>Rồi mỗi bước khiến bước sau khó hơn</text>
      <rect x="20" y="242" width="191" height="106" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="32" y="264" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Link returns</text><text x="32" y="264" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Đường truyền trở lại</text>
      <text x="32" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-en>App tier starts sending</text><text x="32" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Tầng app bắt đầu gửi</text>
      <text x="32" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-en>writes to the new West</text><text x="32" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>lệnh ghi tới primary</text>
      <text x="32" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-en>primaries.</text><text x="32" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>mới ở West.</text>
      <path d="M 211 295 L 237.0 295.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="243,295 235.8,298.5 235.8,291.5" class="hd" />
      <rect x="243" y="242" width="191" height="106" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="255" y="264" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Both sides diverged</text><text x="255" y="264" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Hai bên lệch dữ liệu</text>
      <text x="255" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-en>East has writes West lacks;</text><text x="255" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>East có ghi mà West thiếu;</text>
      <text x="255" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-en>West has new writes East</text><text x="255" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>West có ghi mới mà East</text>
      <text x="255" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-en>lacks.</text><text x="255" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>thiếu.</text>
      <path d="M 434 295 L 460.0 295.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="466,295 458.8,298.5 458.8,291.5" class="hd" />
      <rect x="466" y="242" width="191" height="106" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="478" y="264" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Fail-back is unsafe</text><text x="478" y="264" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Không thể chuyển ngược</text>
      <text x="478" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-en>GitHub chose to keep the</text><text x="478" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>GitHub chọn giữ nguyên</text>
      <text x="478" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-en>data intact, restore East</text><text x="478" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>dữ liệu, dựng lại East</text>
      <text x="478" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-en>from backups.</text><text x="478" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>từ bản backup.</text>
      <path d="M 657 295 L 683.0 295.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="689,295 681.8,298.5 681.8,291.5" class="hd" />
      <rect x="689" y="242" width="191" height="106" rx="6" class="box-r" />
      <text x="701" y="264" class="t-r" data-lang-en>24 h 11 min degraded</text><text x="701" y="264" class="t-r" data-lang-vi>24 giờ 11 phút suy giảm</text>
      <text x="701" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Pages that write crossed</text><text x="701" y="284" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Trang có ghi phải đi xuyên</text>
      <text x="701" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-en>the country until East</text><text x="701" y="300" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>nước cho tới khi East</text>
      <text x="701" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-en>was primary again.</text><text x="701" y="316" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>lại là primary.</text>
      <text x="20" y="374" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Source: GitHub's October 21 post-incident analysis. Fix GitHub named: stop Orchestrator promoting primaries across regions.</text><text x="20" y="374" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Nguồn: phân tích sự cố ngày 21/10 của GitHub. Cách sửa GitHub nêu: không cho Orchestrator nâng primary xuyên vùng.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A majority can be right about who the leader is and still be wrong for the applications that depend on it. The quorum had no idea the app tier could not live with a cross-country primary.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một đa số có thể đúng về chuyện ai là leader mà vẫn sai với các ứng dụng phụ thuộc vào nó. Quorum không biết tầng app không chịu nổi primary đặt xa nửa nước Mỹ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dgf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dgf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dgf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dgf text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dgf .t-h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dgf .t-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dgf .t-r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .dgf .t-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .dgf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dgf .box-r { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dgf .box-d { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dgf .box-q { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .dgf .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dgf .ln-r { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dgf .ln-d { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dgf .ln-g { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .dgf .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dgf .hd-r { fill: var(--red); }
  .dgf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
